Comment: No game data is part of this package. Diablo's DIABDAT.MPQ, Hellfire's hf*.mpq and the
 shareware spawn.mpq are Blizzard's and come from the player's own copy. The ZeroTier library in
 dist/libzt-src is in the source but not built.

